OL,3,ADR Congo says aircraft missing as
OL,4,Arebels claim to shoot down plane
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Democratic Republic of Congo says
OL,7,Fit is searching for one of its
OL,8,Faircraft, after rebels said they had
OL,9,Fshot down a warplane in the east.
OL,11,FThe military said it had lost contact
OL,12,Fwith a small Cessna 208 cargo plane on
OL,13,FSunday following "poor weather
OL,14,Fconditions". The fate of the plane and
OL,15,Fits crew remained uncertain, it added.
OL,17,FOn the same day, the rebel Front for
OL,18,Fthe Refoundation of the Nation (FRN)
OL,19,Fsaid it had shot down a warplane that
OL,20,Fwas on a mission to bomb Minembwe in
OL,21,FSouth Kivu province.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
